config MTK_CCU
	tristate "MTK_CCU"
	help
	  Support 3A using CCU hardware
	  Offers speed up of 3A, including
	  Faster control flow and
	  Stabler frame rate.

config MTK_CCU_RPROC
	tristate "MTK CCU remoteproc driver for ISP71"
	depends on REMOTEPROC
	help
	  Support CCU (Camera Control Unit) as a remoteproc device
	  for ISP71-based platforms (MT6879/Dimensity 7030).
	  The CCU handles 3A algorithms offloaded to a dedicated
	  co-processor, communicating via IPI (Inter-Processor Interrupt).

